# Fabric Inspection Process

Practical process documentation for checking fabric when it arrives, before it is cut, sold or sent to a tailor.

Written for boutiques, small labels, fabric retailers and anyone who buys fabric in bulk and wants a simple, repeatable quality check.

Maintained with input from the team at [Paras Gallery Fabrics](https://parasgalleryfabrics.com/), a fabric retail and wholesale house in Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi.

