## Suggested workflow

1. Log the delivery: supplier, fabric, design code, dye lot, roll count and metres.
2. Run a four-point inspection on a sample of rolls.
3. Check shade within each roll and across rolls.
4. Run a shrinkage test on a swatch.
5. Record results and decide: accept, accept with notes or raise with the supplier.

